OL,3,GNEWSAShipping loan extended after
OL,4,Afinancial concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #300,000 loan to an island shipping
OL,7,Ffirm has been extended and a warning
OL,8,Fissued over the need for improvements
OL,9,Fto the company's financial reporting
OL,10,Fand governance.
OL,12,FThe move by the government of Sark in
OL,13,Fthe Channel Islands on the loan to the
OL,14,FIsle of Sark Shipping Company, comes
OL,15,Fweeks after it emerged the island-owned
OL,16,Fferry operator was at risk of
OL,17,Fdefaulting on the loan when it becomes
OL,18,Fdue on 31 August.
OL,20,FAbout #270,000 of the loan facility has
OL,21,Fbeen drawn down and none of the capital
OL,22,Fhas yet been repaid.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
