OL,3,GNEWSAShipping loan extended after
OL,4,Afinancial concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shipping company operates Sark's
OL,7,Fyear-round passenger and freight link
OL,8,Fwith Guernsey, carrying about 50,000
OL,9,Freturn passengers each year.
